  "no_raw_echo": "Native tail_words/proof_bytes are not serialized wholesale. Each decoder's typed credential/versions/command/legal/spend/read/ACK/governance fields drive the summary. Only actual typed proof-byte fields and canonical encoding of an already decoded OriginalCore are bytes nodes; recursive original typed IR is also mandatory.",
  "read_boundary": "The existing model materializes session_proof(epoch from canonical Core) and Current expected cut. Rust/Go visitors must use the actual decoded read plus the same canonical Core epoch; do not re-run a competing raw operand parser.",
  "accepted_refused": "Summary is present only after the existing transport oracle accepts first0 or identical1. Refusal has null summary/core/signing/key observations. An accepted path whose actual typed decoder cannot supply the summary must fail the comparison as incomplete; never substitute Accept/bool or an empty summary.",
